s="new" lang="EN">MATERIALS FOR PREVENTING ARTERIOSCLEROSIS, IMMUNOPOTENTIATING MATERIALS, VERTEBRATES FED WITH THESE MATERIALS AND EGGS THEREOF</invention-title> <invention-title load-source="docdb" status="new" lang="FR">SUBSTANCES PERMETTANT D'EVITER LA SURVENUE DE L'ARTERIOSCLEROSE, SUBSTANCES IMMUNOSTIMULANTES, VERTEBRES NOURRIS A L'AIDE CES SUBSTANCES ET OEUFS DE CES VERTEBRES</invention-title><citations><patent-citations><patcit ucid="EP-0824873-A1" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>EP</country><doc-number>0824873</doc-number><kind>A1</kind></document-id> <sources><source category="Y" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources> </patcit> <patcit ucid="JP-10226642-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>10226642</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="A"  name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="JP-10313814-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>10313814</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="Y" name="SEA"  created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="JP-8214787-A"  status="new"><document-id status="new"  format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>8214787</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="Y" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="WO-1995016362-A1" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>WO</country><doc-number>1995016362</doc-number><kind>A1</kind></document-id><sources><source category="Y" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="WO-1998043398-A1" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>WO</country><doc-number>1998043398</doc-number><kind>A1</kind></document-id><sources><source category="Y" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit></patent-citations><non-patent-citations><nplcit status="new"><text>See also references of EP     1070504A1</text><sources><source name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit><nplcit status="new"><text>WANG WEIGUN ET AL.: 'Individual and combinatory effects of soy isoflavones on the in vitro potentiation of lymphocyte activation' NUTR. CANCER, vol. 29, no. 1, 1997, pages 29 - 34, XP002927693</text><sources><source category="Y" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit><nplcit status="new"><text>ZHANG RONGGING ET AL.: 'Enhancement of immune function in mice fed high doses of soy daidzein' NUTR. CANCER, vol. 29, no. 1, 1997, pages 24 - 28, XP002927692</text><sources><source category="Y" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NICHIMO KK</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAKEBE MINORU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NICHIMO CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKEBE, MINORU</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAKEBE MINORU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKEBE, MINORU</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>Materials for preventing arteriosclerosis and immunopotentiating materials having an effect of preventing arteriosclerosis and thus contributing to the maintenance of good health of vertebrates which are produced by inoculating beans with a koji-mold to produce koji and adding water the koji product thus obtained to thereby hydrolyze proteins and/or saccharides contained in the product, or by using the characteristic of coexisting and living in symbiosis with a lactic acid bacterium which is inherently contained in the starting material or added thereto; vertebrates excluding humans grown by feeding with these materials for preventing arteriosclerosis and immunopotentiating materials and eggs thereof.  When added to, for example, foods, feeds, etc. in an appropriate amount, these materials for preventing arteriosclerosis and immunopotentiating materials are absorbed via the digestive tracts and exert the effects of preventing arteriosclerosis and/or immunopotentiation.  Thus, these vertebrates can be surely prevented from the onset of arteriosclerosis and the immunity thereof can be potentiated, thereby contributing to the maintenance and promotion of good health, prevention of diseases, etc.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Cette invention a trait à des substances permettant d'éviter la survenue de l'artériosclérose ainsi qu'à des substances immunostimulantes douées de la même action, lesquelles substances contribuent à maintenir des vertébrés en bonne santé. On produit ces substances en inoculant une moisissure de koji à des graines afin de produire du koji et en ajoutant de l'eau au koji ainsi obtenu afin d'hydrolyser les protéines et ou les saccharides que renferme ce produit. Il est également possible de produire ces substances en les faisant coexister et vivre en symbiose avec une bactérie lactique inhérente à l'agent initiateur ou qui lui est ajoutée. L'invention porte, de surcroît, sur des vertébrés, à l'exception de l'homme, et sur leurs oeufs, vertébrés dont la croissance est assurée par administration de ces substances et des substances immunostimulantes susmentionnées et ce, dans le cadre de la prévention de l'artériosclérose. Une fois ajoutées à l'alimentation, par exemple, sous des quantités convenables, ces substances de prévention de l'artériosclérose et ces substances immunostimulantes sont absorbées par le tractus digestif et ont une action de prévention de l'artériosclérose ainsi qu'une action immunostimulante. Dans la mesure où ces substances protègent de manière incontestable des vertébrés contre l'artériosclérose et renforcent leur capacité immunitaire, elles contribuent à les maintenir en bonne santé et à les protéger contre des maladies, etc.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>